      <guid>https://hughandbecky.us/kids/katja/post/the-old-books/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;When I was in 6th grade my grandpa flew to Germany and stayed with us for a few weeks. He and I pulled out my dad’s train set and put it together. I remember the really old catalogs from the 1950s that my dad had. &lt;img src=&#34;img_8101.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&#34; /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tonight Katja was sitting on my lap looking at my old LEGO catalogs. She must have sat there for 45 minutes going through them.&lt;/p&gt;
